OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry for
OL,6,Fmany. Isolated thunderstorms pushing
OL,7,Feastwards this evening and overnight,
OL,8,Fwith heavy downpours particularly
OL,9,Fpossible over eastern England. Warm
OL,10,Fand muggy in the southeast, but
OL,11,Ffresher than recent nights elsewhere.
OL,12,FA few showers for northern Scotland.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSaturday:FStill very warm and humid
OL,15,Ffor southeast England as heavy showers
OL,16,Fand thunderstorms clear. Widely fine
OL,17,Felsewhere with sunny spells and nearer
OL,18,Faverage temperatures, though showers
OL,19,Fcontinuing for northern Scotland.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
